      "content": "That's a good start. To make the paper really high quality, I need to dig deeper into the \"social chaos\" part. Could you expand on the specific \"scientific\" or sociological reasoning they used? Like, what were the actual theories they cited regarding how mixing different groups would impact societal stability or the preservation of culture? I want to show the intellectual framework they actually relied on.",
